# Mission // #002

## Easy Come, Easy Go

*“Where there's heat, there's life!”*  


# Goals

- Protect USB personell and assets.
- Assist in the investigation of unknown phenomenon.
- Follow. Protocol.

# Stakes

- Furthering of Union's scientific knowledge.
- Confirmation of the safety of this planet.
- Establishing a solid track record with USB management.

---

> Listen up. Last mission didn't conclude the way CentComm was hoping for. You prevented the Omninet Node from falling into unknown hands, and you operated the best you could given the circumstances, but the disappearence of an entire outpost isn't the kind of thing that can just be brushed off. Point is, the Silver Lining is under a lot of scrutiny right now, so I want you on your best behavior. Now, today should be a fairly routine operation. The otherwise unremarkable ice world Civvy 4 has been observed demonstrating some "unique thermal phenomenon" that shouldn't be possible given what we know of it. Doctor Daramy wishes to take an up-close-and-personal look, and it's your job to keep her safe from whatever's down there, be that above or below the ice. I'd reccomend packing hand-warmers for this one. Suit up, rangers.

> Captain Bravilles
